---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
---

<section class="space-y-16!">
  <!-- FAQ SEARCH HEADER -->
  <div
    class="surface shadow-none! mb-12 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 p-8 md:flex-row"
  >
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Have a specific question?</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-md">Search our documentation or contact our Florida support team.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative w-full max-w-md">
      <input
        type="text"
        placeholder="Search for answers..."
        class="bg-neutral-lo border-neutral-md focus:ring-info-hi w-full border p-4 pl-12 outline-hidden focus:ring-2"
      />
      <svg
        class="text-neutral-md absolute top-4 left-4 size-5"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Category: General SEO Questions -->
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <h3 class="border-info-lo border-b-2 pb-4 text-3xl font-bold">General SEO Questions</h3>
    <div class="surface divide-neutral-md divide-y p-2 shadow-none!">
      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">What makes Onio Insights different?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            We are a data-first agency based in Florida, focusing on transparent results and local
            expertise. We don't just "do SEO"—we engineer discoverability through advanced analytics
            and technical precision.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">How long does it take to see improvements?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            SEO is a marathon. Typically, our clients see significant movement within 3-6 months,
            depending on the competitiveness of their industry and the current technical state of
            their site.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Category: Strategy & Implementation -->
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <h3 class="border-info-lo border-b-2 pb-4 text-3xl font-bold">Strategy & Implementation</h3>
    <div class="surface divide-neutral-md divide-y p-2 shadow-none!">
      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Do you focus specifically on Florida?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            While we are proud to be Florida-based, we work with brands across the globe. Our local
            SEO expertise is a major advantage for Sunshine State businesses looking to dominate
            their market.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">What SEO tools do you use for auditing?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            We use a combination of industry leaders like SEMrush and Ahrefs, alongside our
            proprietary AI-driven analytics platform to get the deepest data possible for our
            clients.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Category: Reporting & Success -->
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <h3 class="border-info-lo border-b-2 pb-4 text-3xl font-bold">Reporting & Success</h3>
    <div class="surface divide-neutral-md divide-y p-2 shadow-none!">
      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">How do you handle keyword research?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            We go beyond high-volume terms. We analyze intent, competition, and semantic relevance
            to find keywords that actually convert, ensuring your SEO investment drives real
            revenue.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="item group transition-all open:pb-6">
        <summary
          class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-6 focus:outline-hidden"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Can I track the progress of my SEO?</h4>
          <Icon name="mdi:plus" class="text-info-hi size-6 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45" />
        </summary>
        <div class="px-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-md">
            Absolutely. Every client gets access to a real-time dashboard where you can track
            rankings, traffic, and conversion metrics 24/7 with full transparency.
          </p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
